        "alt_text": "Email title: \n\nRequest for Prison Psychiatrist to review R009202024 Vickreman Harvey Chettiar SPS:0000158000017.\n\nEmail body:\n\n\nFrom: SPS_CRM_system_notification@pris.gov.sg. \nThu, Aug 1, 9:25 AM.\nto me, MPS.\n\nDear Ms Loh,\n \n             We refer to your representation to Member of Parliament for Sembawang GRC, Mr Ong Ye Kung, dated 10 Jul 2024, requesting for the prison psychiatrist to review R009202024 Vickreman Harvey Chettiar’s diagnosis of gender dysphoria.  \n \n2.           Please be assured that Harvey is provided with the necessary medical care.\n\n3.           Thank you.\n\n\nYours sincerely,\n \nReuben Leong.\nOC Correctional Unit 2.\nfor SUPERINTENDENT.\nINSTITUTION B1.\nSINGAPORE PRISON SERVICE.\n \ncc:\nONG YE KUNG.\nMP FOR SENBAWANG GRC - Please refer to your letter dated 10/07/2024 (Ref: SC130A/240710-059-A).",
